    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "All of the Reunion teams I could reach have pulled out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a lot of people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's incredible... like a river.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll be a river out there in the wilderness... a river of refugees.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nesti"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's Ursus and Lugmenites out there. Infected and ordinary folk alike. No matter what they came with, they're leaving empty-handed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nesti"
    },
    {
        "text": "They thought there was a place that would take them. Now they know there's never anywhere they could've gone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nesti"
    },
    {
        "text": "This river won't flow forever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nesti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "(He sounds so sad.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(He picked that up from Big Daddy.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(No wonder. Anyone would get sentimental at a time like this.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If Big Daddy was here, we would've won the fight and it wouldn't have come to this, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's the luck of the draw. No use thinking about how things could've been.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "......Get ready. I'll go talk it over with the Phantom Crossbowmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't rush me. It's not like I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry up already. Quit screwing around.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm pretty choked up too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_indoor_n",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Yeti Squad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What about Amiya and her people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They're already on their way. Amiya said to tell you to 'take it easy'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "She knows better than to tell me that. It's me, Blaze. When do I ever take it easy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze! Where are you going?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "To save lives!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_undergroud_n",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Crossbowmen! Wait up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yetis... what are you doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Sister FrostNova... She's growing weak. She can't keep this up for long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "She exhausted her energy pushing back Lungmen's forces. She may not wake up for a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean you want us to take her with us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we aren't going back to Chernobog. Faust didn't want Mephisto to go back...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're begging you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "We want Sister to be together with Patriot, in the end!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "We know, they're not exactly getting along right now, but... their bond is stronger than blood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "So please... we beg of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what will you do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll cover you. If we don't hold them back, the Lungmenites will catch you in no time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once you're all far enough away from Lungmen that you're no longer a threat to them, they'll give up the chase.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But that means, you guys will...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Live by the sword, die by the sword. We're okay with dying in battle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "The future that Sister FrostNova spoke of is still a ways away. But we don't need to see it for ourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We owe you our lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's nothing. You're saving our Sister.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...We will do what you ask of us. I swear it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Take these armguards. And put on this protective suit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Our Sister is far too cold for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...She...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "...She's so light...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Arts have emptied her body. Easy now, easy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't wake her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at her... look how softly she sleeps.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Goodbye, Sister...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll be waiting for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...All right then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's... move on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's us that's moving on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll meet again, Yetis.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not too soon, I hope.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_indoor_f",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member D"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are we going to die?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Ursine profanity*, what are you crying for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you a Yeti or not?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you not crying?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What am I crying about...?! Did you forget what Sister said?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "She said not to cry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right! She said not to cry... More than a decade ago, she said not to cry! So I don't want to see any tears! We don't get to cry... because we haven't won yet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Once we win, once we're free...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Once we're free, we'll cry our eyes out, in the wilderness, in the snow, in the stacks of wheat piled high, we'll be bawling!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sister was crying as she said it, you know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She was only nine at the time. We were all a little older than her...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Without her, we would have died in that mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you bring the sauce?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Bring the what...? Wait, I thought we weren't allowed to bring it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not allowed to drink on the march, but you had it with you, I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I want a drink too...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not old enough yet, are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "B- but I've never tried before. I don't want to die without ever tasting it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give him a little.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Petrova...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, take a swig. But not too much, we all need a share.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Na zdorovye, brothers! Warm up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "To Sister! And Big Daddy!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "To FrostNova! And Patriot!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad All Together"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know these Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do, Officer Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this final battle must be fought.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do we have a choice?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "We may not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look behind you. They're not even trying to hide themselves anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...The black raincoats.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_038",
        "name2": "avg_npc_038",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "So, we have to fight them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is what we must do. If we don't, we'll fall short. And the business of pushing the special forces into the Yetis becomes pretty unconvincing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unless you could convince them to surrender?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as there's Infected behind them... they won't give up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't force you to fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Officer Ch'en. But... but we will witness it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The L. G. D. fought bravely, no one can deny that. You fought for Lungmen, against the invaders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is how we will help you against those special forces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And for our sake... We must record every battle for the Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every single one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Officer Ch'en?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "When this battle is over, let's grab a bite together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "B- but I'm Infected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care. The loudmouth and the tall lady? They won't mind either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "This battle... it's going to cost a lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "For us, it's a battle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "For Lungmen, it's a war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that's what war is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "But whoever it was who planned all this, they're not here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say, there's something I have to tell you\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014But not right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. Not right now, Officer Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Don't want to watch?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mhm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "But just like in the ruins of Chernobog...",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right. I decided.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to see it... with my own eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Together.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_indoor_f",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So we don't call her Big Sister because she's older than us...? Why am I just learning this now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, it works for you. You were three years old back then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Pfft!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, what's with the attitude? Did you get drunk off two sips? When you cried out for food, did I feed you or not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That was then, this is... now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, it's funny. I'm suddenly thinking about those Rhodes Islanders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "That one cat, with the hot body, the one who said she wanted to drink with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's too bad. She looked like she'd be able to hold her liquor. She looked like a real good time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But the little rabbit, she can't be old enough yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is she? 16? 17?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "More like 14. She just seems older because she talks fancy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "As old as Sister was... back then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's toast them one more time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "text": "So it is said, so shall it be done!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "So shall it be done!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nesti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, uh... so shall it be done!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
