        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_043_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmenites should be more coordinated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Get out of here. The Yetis can only hold them for a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't think what they're doing is incredible?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If we die, then they did it all for nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Phantom Crossbowmen say we can't go back to Chernobog. So we're going to a new place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't care where our new base is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wherever it is, I'm going with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh. You Lungmenites are no different from us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was hoping they'd treat you better here. Turns out it's the same as it was in Ursus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Infected suffer the same everywhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not what you said when you first got here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_043_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "People change.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
