        "height": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yetis? Are those the Yetis?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's the Yetis! R- right...? Definitely!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yetiiiis... Yetiiii! Why are you Yetis like this?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn it! Don't die! I won't let you die!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just hold on, I can save you! I'll get you to safety...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you Infected want to die here?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_indoor_n",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The special forces stopped attacking? No, looks like they're pulling back...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems... they're giving us the initiative.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are we showing the power of Lungmen's law enforcement? *Lungmen profanity* They underestimated us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Never mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen up, this is the last wave! Don't disappoint the people, or Ch'en Sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll show Reunion how powerful Lungmen is! The Infected won't dare attack our city again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L. G. D. Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_indoor_f",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phantom Crossbowmen, don't let us down. You have to get our Sister back to the old man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "text": "...She's running out of time. She should spend it with him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't have much time left ourselves, eh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ready?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Petrova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_037",
        "name2": "avg_npc_037",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ready. Let's give back our lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's show them what the squad trained by Buldrokkas'tee, Ursus's greatest soldier, and led by it's coldest nightmare, can do!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yeti Squad Member B"
    },
